"""Reproducible, dependency-free offline evaluation of the HW3 CF methods.

Example:
    python3 tests/evaluate_cf.py --output docs/evaluation-results.json

The 80/10/10 split is fixed before fitting any means or similarities. Every
validation/test pair has its user and movie represented in training. New-user
and new-movie behaviour is checked separately in the hand-case self-test.
Validation is diagnostic here: hyperparameters are the values predeclared in
docs/HW3_PLAN.md, and the test split is used once with those fixed values.
